  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Located in Sandestin, a gated community. The property is in excellent condition, extremely clean, and comes with a 2018 golf cart that seats 6. This is a 3 bedroom and 2 bath with a pullout sofa. This house has all the amenities you would want. The kitchen is accommodated with all the appliances you would like to have. It has high end appliances with a SubZero extra large refrigerator. The kitchen table seats 8 + 3 at the bar. Nice to start the day or end the day in the large screened-in porch. Plenty of space to be outside, but away from the bugs. The master bedroom has a king bed and a bathroom with shower, double sink, and walk-in closet. The other two bedrooms each have a queen bed and share a bathroom between them. Perfect for vacationing families. This is a non-smoking property. The Bungalo pool is just a few steps away. <br><br>The beach is close by (5 minutes by car and under 10 minutes on the golf cart). The Bungalo is in the Sandestin Golf and Beach Resort, a 2,400 acre resort with a beautiful private beach, four golf courses, over 40 restaurants, live entertainment, tennis, spa, numerous shops and much more. Be sure to check out Baytowne Village and Grand Boulevard!<br><br>We own and rent 3 Bungalos. The other two are VRBO#1651246 and 450597. Additionally, we have 4 other properties in Sandestin. VRBO # 2614941, 2484080, 2165894, 2165222.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
