        "rating": 8,
        "text": "Stayed with a group of friends (5 in total). The house was nice and in a great area. We always love Sandestin. The golf cart made getting around the area easy. We had a couple issues during our stay but Brandi was responsive and helpful. We just wished a FEW more basics were provided (like salt and pepper, bath mats outside the shower, more blankets, etc). However, there is a good stash of beach gear for anyone visiting that doesn’t have their own which is definitely a plus. Overall, we enjoyed our week at the bungalo and would for sure consider booking here again!",
